Rule 7 (If start_dim is a valid dimension, the corresponding shape should be greater than 0)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 ≥ (0 - ndim(v_1)) ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1) then shape(v_1, if v_2 < 0 then v_2 + ndim(v_1) else v_2) > 0
