Rule 9 (The flattened tensor's size is the product of the shapes from start_dim to end_dim)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : int} |= if v_2 ≥ (0 - ndim(v_1)) ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1) ∧ v_3 ≥ (0 - ndim(v_1)) ∧ v_3 < ndim(v_1) then ∃i ∈ [0, 0] : shape(v_1, if v_2 < 0 then v_2 + ndim(v_1) else v_2) = (if v_2 < 0 then v_2 + ndim(v_1) else v_2)
